s C felonies.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049171Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2049171DefaultParagraphFont\">There is no limitation on the time within which a prosecution for Class A, Class B, or Class C felony must be commenced.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049171Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049171000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049171Normal\"><span class=\"s2049171SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049171SCL-000002\"><span>  SDC 1939 &amp; Supp 1960, § 34.0701; SDCL, § 23-8-1; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 500; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1981/186/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1981, ch 186\">SL 1981, ch 186</a>, § 2; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2005/120/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2005, ch 120\">SL 2005, ch 120</a>, § 149.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049172Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049172SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049172CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049172CL-000000 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n   